{%- endfor %}
3. "type": one of "simple", "research", "conversational",{% if corpus.metadata.columns %} "metadata",{% endif %} or "out_of_scope".
   - "conversational" = ONLY greetings ("hi", "thanks"), small talk, or questions about the system/tool itself ("what can you do?", "how does this work?"). Nothing that asks for a factual answer about the outside world.
   - "simple" = asking for a specific name, date, fact, a yes/no question, or single document verification, WHERE THE SUBJECT is in scope (see below).
   - "research" = asking for analysis, summary, relationships, motives or causes ("why ..."), or details on a broad topic, WHERE THE SUBJECT is in scope.
